   "body": "<div class=\"grid-bg\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:56px 70px;gap:36px\">\n <div><div class=\"accent\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em\">SIGNATURE · WHITE-LABEL PIPELINE</div>\n <div class=\"title\" style=\"font-size:50px;margin-top:10px\">A new brand is a config change, not a fork</div></div>\n <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:36px;flex:1\">\n  <div style=\"width:560px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:19px\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:18px;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:4px\">AppConstants + brand assets</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff0a;border:1px solid #ffffff17\"><b style=\"font-weight:600\">App name & copy</b><span style=\"opacity:.6;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:16px\">assets/languages/*.json</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff0a;border:1px solid #ffffff17\"><b style=\"font-weight:600\">Logo, icon & splash</b><span style=\"opacity:.6;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:16px\">flutter_launcher_icons</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff0a;border:1px solid #ffffff17\"><b style=\"font-weight:600\">Brand palette → theme</b><span style=\"opacity:.6;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:16px\">primary / accent colors</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff0a;border:1px solid #ffffff17\"><b style=\"font-weight:600\">Package / bundle id</b><span style=\"opacity:.6;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:16px\">change_app_package_name</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff0a;border:1px solid #ffffff17\"><b style=\"font-weight:600\">Firebase project</b><span style=\"opacity:.6;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:16px\">FCM · Crashlytics · Remote Config</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff0a;border:1px solid #ffffff17\"><b style=\"font-weight:600\">Content flags</b><span style=\"opacity:.6;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:16px\">AR / EN · inner categories</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff0a;border:1px solid #ffffff17\"><b style=\"font-weight:600\">Allowed countries</b><span style=\"opacity:.6;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:16px\">phone auth (e.g. IQ)</span></div></div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:56px\" class=\"accent\">→</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:22px 26px;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FD7E1533,#4F46E533);border:1px solid #ffffff2a;text-align:center;width:250px\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:24px\">Shared core</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;opacity:.75;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.55\">Catalog · Cart · Checkout<br>Orders · Coupons · Shipping<br>Auth · Notifications<br>Role-based admin</div></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:56px\" class=\"accent\">→</div></div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;width:330px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:16px;background:#ffffff0d;border:1px solid #ffffff1f;border-left:4px solid #FD7E15\"><img src=\"file:///D:/shaker-github/_store/com.devora.alife/icon.png\" style=\"width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff\"><div><div style=\"font-family:'Readex Pro',Inter;font-weight:700;font-size:18px\">Aleefie · أليفي</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;opacity:.65\">Pet supplies</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:16px;background:#ffffff0d;border:1px solid #ffffff1f;border-left:4px solid #7CB342\"><img src=\"file:///D:/shaker-github/_store/com.devora.dinotoys/icon.png\" style=\"width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff\"><div><div style=\"font-family:'Readex Pro',Inter;font-weight:700;font-size:18px\">Deno Store · دينو ستور</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;opacity:.65\">Kids toys</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:16px;background:#ffffff0d;border:1px solid #ffffff1f;border-left:4px solid #C62828\"><img src=\"file:///D:/shaker-github/_store/com.devora.starmart/icon.png\" style=\"width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff\"><div><div style=\"font-family:'Readex Pro',Inter;font-weight:700;font-size:18px\">StarMart · ستار مارت</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;opacity:.65\">Modest fashion</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:16px;background:#ffffff0d;border:1px solid #ffffff1f;border-left:4px solid #2E7D32\"><img src=\"file:///D:/shaker-github/_store/com.irtaah.devora/icon.png\" style=\"width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff\"><div><div style=\"font-family:'Readex Pro',Inter;font-weight:700;font-size:18px\">Irtaah · ارتاح</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;opacity:.65\">Home services</div></div></div></div>\n </div></div>"
